own-horizon runs, not one anytime schedule or a uniform cutoff over unbounded comparators.\n\nThe source-implicit threshold delta>=0 includes0; actual complete real Hilbert-space formulas include the finite Euclidean source. Current features are available before prediction and labels afterwards. Actual seam derivatives, global convexity, vector gradients, full-space projection identity and global RegularLoss are produced. The fixed-positive-step bound retains its negative terminal distance for every T>=0, including zero-horizon cancellation. No bounded predictor domain, label/residual/diameter premise or desired regret/regularity oracle is added. Coefficient1 is one source proportional-step instance.\n\nONE printed example,19retained supporting proofs and3complete definitions are audited; no new mathematical proof code or registry nodes. Only a leading ordinary ignored scope comment and the selected Huber reader subtree change. All original proof/definition bytes remain as the module suffix,19native headers/mathematical tokens/whole14-proof canary/root/Tests are fixed. Eight distinct source-review reader qualifications are applied.\n\nValidation:\n\n- Focused module, all19actual public bodies, whole14genuine canaries,36unique named axiom audits (standard-three-or-none/no sorryAx), and19separate native guards passed. Required distinct automated CONTRACT/BODY/FINAL reviewer decisions recorded; requested Astra/medium, no human/external/runtime-model attestation.\n- Sequential combined root9089jobs/Tests9232jobs and full harness466tests/seven existing skips passed. Fresh gate invocations include cached jobs; no clean rebuild of every job claim.\n- Actual scoped compiled graph22nodes/2954direct type/value references includes three definitions and real producer/terminal edges; not a full/canary export. Clean lean-verified local site at `be864c045ce116042548aa478c286b98a68ffa83`,22canonical shared scoped nodes/all10809oldIDsURLs/zero new nodes, site checks and viewed first browser viewport passed.\n- Exact stacked contributor gate/history raw bindings/task-only frontier and shadow/scoped CRLF-aware whitespace passed. Default raw whitespace diagnostics retain exact command output/CRLF; real trailing-blank checks and enumerated raw exceptions remain. Run-local * -text preserved current-run evidence bytes from start; committed-raw audit passed, no blanket older cross-platform recertification. Read-only lookup mistakes and pre-gate exact boundary-phrase compatibility are recorded; no mathematics or tests weakened. Global reference-index rewrite was not run outside this bounded reuse window.\n\nStacked on OPEN draft#164 at exact52f628a7ae699887069c5a621d301901718ed772, not main. Main-relative diagnostics still lack9other legacy production contracts. This accepts only Example2.15's retained supporting chain, reducing legacy migrations11→10 for OnlineHuber only, with zero new-proof gain. Chapter1 migration and Chapter2 mandatory total remain incomplete/null; the Chapters1–16 Goal stays active. No merge, deployment, main/live update or worktree retirement.\n\nEvidence: runs/online-huber-migration-20261006/{accepted-decision-v1.json,integrated-gates-overlay-v1.json,final-reader-receipt-v1.json,accepted-binding-audit-v1.json}; frozen source/statement contracts: docs/contracts/online-huber-migration-v1.\n","created_at":"2026-10-05T18:21:18Z","updated_at":"2026-10-05T18:23:23Z","closed_at":null,"merged_at":null,"merge_commit_sha":"6c98716d8e7878cd691e0c59fd24cff6939331eb","assignees":[],"requested_reviewers":[],"requested_teams":[],"labels":[],"milestone":null,"draft":true,"commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DakeBU/Auto-Bandit-RL-Proof-In-Sleep/pulls/165/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DakeBU/Auto-Bandit-RL-Proof-In-Sleep/pulls/165/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DakeBU/Auto-Bandit-RL-Proof-In-Sleep/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DakeBU/Auto-